WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:09.080
Every year Forbes compiles a list of the most
powerful people on earth, based on the amount

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:14.660
of human and financial resources the have
control over, as well as their influence on

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.920
world events.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:26.160
Let's reveal the top 10 and more importantly
find out what makes them so powerful.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.590
10.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.210
First up at number 10 is David Cameron.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.300
Current prime minister of the United Kingdom.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:42.560
The United Kingdom is the the 6th wealthiest
country on Earth, which is quite impressive

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:47.049
when you considering it's relatively small
size and population.

00:00:47.049 --> 00:00:53.949
But what really makes the United Kingdom and
subsequently David Cameron so powerful, is

00:00:53.949 --> 00:01:00.070
its strong relationship with some of the most
powerful and wealthiest nations on Earth,

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:06.600
such as Iran, Canada, New Zealand, Australia,
and most of Europe.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.869
But of course the UK's closest ally is the
United States of America.

00:01:12.869 --> 00:01:19.740
The two nations have a "Special Relationship",
seriously that's actually what it's called.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.380
The two countries share intelligence, military
and their economies.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:30.079
The UK is also one of the few countries that
has active nuclear weapons, in the form of

00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:32.780
their fearsome nuclear trident programme.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:40.570
A chunk of David Cameron's power was almost
lost in 2014 when Scotland came close to gaining

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:47.220
independence in the Scottish Referendum, but
voters narrowly kept Scotland as part of the

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.220
UK.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:50.780
Retaining Cameron's number 10 spot.

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:51.780
9.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.619
At number 9 is a joint entry from the world
of business.

00:01:55.619 --> 00:02:01.960
Both tied for 9th place are the founders of
search engine giant, Google, Sergey Brin and

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.460
Larry Page.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:10.600
Their company Google, is unarguably the most
influential company of the digital era.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:16.319
Maintaining the majority share in online search
Google has the unbelievable power of being

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:18.560
able to curate the internet.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:23.450
Google are also buying up big companies left,
right and centre.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:30.459
In fact since 2001 Google has purchased companies
at a rate of 1 per month.

00:02:30.459 --> 00:02:35.730
Most notably YouTube, DoubleClick, Nest and
Makani Power.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:41.870
Google also owns the Android mobile operating
system, more than a billion devices around

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.960
the world run the software.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:49.920
They also have their highly secretive Google
X research labs which is responsible for bringing

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:56.340
future technologies to the present day, such
as self driving cars, Google Glass and more

00:02:56.340 --> 00:03:02.010
recently their Calico programme, which is
working on curing diseases such as cancer

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:06.250
and alzheimer's and massively extending people's
life spans.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.250
8.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.200
At 8 is Mario Draghi.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:16.159
hilariously nicknamed Super Mario, he is the
president of the European Central Bank.

00:03:16.159 --> 00:03:21.290
It's easy to see where all his power comes
from when you consider that he is in charge

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:28.310
of a company that manages the economies and
financial unities across 18 different countries

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:32.739
in Europe, which is the world's wealthiest
continent.

00:03:32.739 --> 00:03:39.090
It's also worth noting that Mario was previously
managing director of Goldman Sachs International.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.090
7.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.930
At 7 is Microsoft founder Bill Gates.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:49.920
There's no arguing with his place on this
list, since he is the wealthiest person in

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:54.189
the world, worth an estimated $76 billion.

00:03:54.189 --> 00:04:01.989
But good old Bill Gates is using his power
in the best possible way, since 2000 his charity,

00:04:01.989 --> 00:04:10.560
The Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation has given
an astonishing $30 billion to charity.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:14.890
Making him the most generous philanthropist
in history.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:21.550
He has also inspired hundreds of other wealthy
individuals to donate their fortunes to charity.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.550
6.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.630
At 6 is Janet Yellen.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:30.260
She is head of the Federal Reserve Bank, the
central bank of the United States.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:38.200
Arguably the most influential bank in the
world with $4.48 trillion in assets.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.780
She is the first female to hold the prestigious
position.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.780
5.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.980
Next up is Angela Merkel.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:47.420
She is Chancellor of Germany.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:53.970
Germany is an economic powerhouse and the
4th wealthiest country in the world.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:05:00.230
Being head of the German government also gives
her tremendous power over the rest of Europe.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:06.660
Most recently she has been using her enormous
power to fight back against ISIS and to deter

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.140
Russia's threats against Ukraine.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.140
4.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:17.630
At 4 is the spiritual leader to one-sixth
of the world's population, that's 1.2 billion

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.880
people, Pope Francis.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:26.730
Possibly the most open minded leader of the
Roman Catholic Church to date, he shocked

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:32.810
the world when he said that the theories of
evolution and the big bang are true and he

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.870
made history when stating "Who am I to judge?"

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:39.220
when asked about his views on homosexuality.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.220
3.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:48.400
At 3 is Xi Jinping, leader of the three major
parties of China, the Communist Party of China,

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.400
the People's Republic of China and China's
Central Military Commission.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:58.090
He is informally referred to as China's "paramount
leader".

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:03.250
Essentially making him leader of the world's
second wealthiest country, China.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:08.790
Some say he is the most powerful Chinese leader
since Mao Zedong.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:09.790
2.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:17.380
At 2 is Barack Obama, officially the most
famous person on this list.

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:24.080
Obama is the 44th and current president of
the United States, and the first African American

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.120
to hold the position.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:32.990
The root of his power is quite simple, America
is the wealthiest nation on Earth, with a

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:41.870
GDP of $17.5 trillion, it also has the world's
largest and most deadly military as well as

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:45.370
ties to a handful of other powerful countries.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:50.560
Despite all his power he has been rapidly
losing support amongst the American people

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:55.400
during his second term in office because of
a handful of events.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:07:03.990
But most notably Obama has increased the National
Debt of the United States by almost 70 percent

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.400
since he took office.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:12.410
But the United States remains the world's
most influential nation, easily justifying

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.550
Obama's place on this list.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.550
1.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:18.770
And finally at number 1 is Vladimir Putin.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:25.300
Vladimir is the President of Russia, the largest
country in the world by landmass.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:31.780
He has a remarkable grip on power, he became
prime minister of Russia in 1999, switching

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:37.210
between president and prime minister in the
years since, eventually settling on president

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.470
in 2012.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:44.420
Effectively making him leader of Russia for
the past 16 years.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:48.180
But what makes Putin more powerful than Obama?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:54.530
Well, when Obama wants to make an important
change he has to drag his feet through congress.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:08:00.800
Putin on the other hand can pretty much do
whatever he wants, when he wants.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:08.910
He heavily exercised this enormous power throughout
2014, most notably by annexing Crimea, starting

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:16.450
a proxy war in Ukraine and landing a $70 billion
gas pipeline deal with China.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:21.170
Which keeps European energy in a frustrating
chokehold.

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:25.640
Basically when other leaders such as David
Cameron and Barack Obama want to exercise

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:31.490
their power they have to fight their way through
hoards of political hurdles, Putin simply

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.430
does what he pleases.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:40.189
And when he does decide to exercise that power,
it's usually an enormously powerful and controversial

00:08:40.189 --> 00:08:46.459
act that makes headlines worldwide.

